    "Biophilia"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "A single common soundscape descriptor is unlikely to be established due to the multi-layered nature of soundscape perception.",
    "There is a critical need for international consensus on relevant soundscape descriptors, numerical scales, and assessment procedures to advance the field.",
    "The choice of an appropriate soundscape descriptor depends on the specific purpose of the study (e.g., to change or to characterize the soundscape)."
  ],
